== Usage ==
=== Note blocks ===
Chiseled tuff bricks can be placed under [[note block]]s to produce "bass drum" sounds.

=== Sulfur cube ===
{{In development|section=1|drop=Chaos Cubed}}
[[Sulfur cube]]s have the ability to absorb chiseled tuff bricks, either through picking them up or being interacted with them. This provides the regular/football effect to the mob when hitting it.

